<title>UK: Electronics to sell goods via Debenhams.</title>
<headline>Electronics to sell goods via Debenhams.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronics Boutique Plc said on Tuesday it has agreed to sell its PC software and video games through department store Debenhams.</p>
<p>The British retailer said it will open units in 16 of Debenhams' 92 stores. Electronics Boutique has 114 stores across the country.</p>
<p>Debenhams is part of the Burton Group.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
